The managed OS sandbox helper uses @anthropic-ai/sandbox-runtime 0.0.81;
its dependency versions and integrity hashes are pinned in
crates/services/sandbox-helper/package-lock.json. Distributed helper resources
include each dependency's original license and notice files.
